deUnverified=true)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="730" y="622" width="470" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c101" value="&lt;b&gt;Ghi chú đọc ma trận (đều từ code)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• API key KHÔNG BAO GIỜ nhận: read:project, replay:deliveries, manage:keys, manage:members, manage:project, traffic:read, storage:read, storage:write — tạo key với các scope này → 422 scope_not_grantable (người tạo key không tự đúc key hay thêm người = chặn leo thang).&lt;br&gt;• read:unverified: người tạo key phải tự có scope đó (owner hoặc operator) → developer cấp thì 403 missing_scope.&lt;br&gt;• Cột Operator = đúng cột owner, nhưng chỉ khi KHÔNG là thành viên project đó; mỗi request ghi audit operator.access.&lt;br&gt;• Web ẩn/hiện nút theo cùng quy tắc (vd canWrite = owner hoặc operator ở sources, storage) nhưng server mới là nơi quyết định." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="682" width="1170" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c102" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="90" width="250" height="136" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c103" value="&lt;b&gt;Chú giải&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1268" y="94" width="230" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c104" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1270" y="120" width="22" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c105" value="Có scope" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="118" width="205" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c106" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#cccccc;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1270" y="148" width="22" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c107" value="Không có" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="146" width="205" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c108" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1270" y="176" width="22" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c109" value="Tiêu đề cột" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="174" width="205" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c110" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1270" y="204" width="22" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c111" value="Tên scope / ghi chú" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="202" width="205" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c112" value="&lt;b&gt;Nơi ma trận được áp dụng&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Người (console): ProjectScopeGuard — scope = ROLE_SCOPES[role] (project-scope.guard.ts:38,72)&lt;br&gt;Máy (/v1/p): ApiKeyGuard — scope = key.scopes lúc tạo (api-key.guard.ts:46-52)&lt;br&gt;Tạo key: parseCreateKey chỉ nhận API_SCOPES (projects.controller.ts:66-84, 302-312)&lt;br&gt;Vé socket: đòi read:project (socket-ticket.service.ts:24)&lt;br&gt;Route chỉ operator: OperatorGuard, nằm NGOÀI ma trận (trang 3)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="260" width="470" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c113" value="&lt;b&gt;Lệch giữa hằng số và hành vi (code thắng)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;KEY_GRANTABLE_SCOPES trong roles.ts:34 liệt kê 7 scope (có storage:read, storage:write) nhưng KHÔNG nơi nào dùng ngoài test; thực thi dùng API_SCOPES (api-key.ts:10) = 5 scope. Cột &amp;#x27;API key cấp được&amp;#x27; vẽ theo hành vi thật." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="580" width="470" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="pg3" name="3. Operator"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1900" pageHeight="1180" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;3 · Operator — được gán thế nào, làm được gì hơn owner, để lại dấu vết gì&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#444444&quot;&gt;Operator là CỜ trên người dùng (users.is_operator), không phải một role trong project_members. Cờ chỉ bật qua seed từ biến môi trường; không có API hay giao diện nào khác bật được.&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1860" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;b&gt;① GÁN CỜ&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="80" width="560" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;Biến môi trường&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;OPERATOR_EMAIL&lt;br&gt;OPERATOR_PASSWORD_HASH (bcrypt)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="110" width="250" height="82" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;b&gt;Seed (khi khởi động/chạy seed)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;seed() → ensureOperator()&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#555555&quot;&gt;seed.ts:119-130,236&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="110" width="260" height="82" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;b&gt;IdentityRepository.ensureOperator&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;chưa có user → tạo mới với is_operator=true, email đã xác minh&lt;br&gt;đã có (cùng email) → CHỈ bật is_operator + đánh dấu đã xác minh, KHÔNG ghi đè mật khẩu&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#555555&quot;&gt;identity.repository.ts:141-152&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="240" width="560" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;b&gt;Đồng thời: membership owner của project &amp;#x27;default&amp;#x27;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;ensureMembership(user, DEFAULT_TENANT_ID, &amp;#x27;owner&amp;#x27;)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#555555&quot;&gt;seed.ts:127&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="385" width="560" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="đọc env" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;b&gt;Chỉ đường này bật được cờ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• createUser (đăng ký công khai) không truyền isOperator → luôn false (auth.service.ts:164)&lt;br&gt;• Không có endpoint nào đổi is_operator; bảng chỉ có cột DEFAULT false (migration auth_identity:18)&lt;br&gt;• Đăng nhập GitHub/Google vào tài khoản operator bị từ chối: operator_github_forbidden / operator_google_forbidden (github-oauth.service.ts:123,129; google-oauth.service.ts:144,150)&lt;br&gt;• Deployed không tự seed: chạy docker-entrypoint.sh seed một lần (DEPLOYMENT.md). Không đặt env → không có operator, console chưa ai quản trị được" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="480" width="560" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="&lt;b&gt;Đăng nhập khác thường dân một điểm&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Tài khoản mật khẩu CHƯA xác minh email thì không đăng nhập được — trừ operator (auth.service.ts:231). Seed vốn đã đặt email_verified_at cho operator." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="695" width="560" height="118" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="&lt;b&gt;② LÀM ĐƯỢC GÌ HƠN OWNER&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="80" width="600" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="&lt;b&gt;Vào MỌI project, scope owner (viaOperator)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Không cần là thành viên. Khác người thường: không thành viên → 404&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#555555&quot;&gt;project-scope.guard.ts:37-38&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="110" width="640" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="&lt;b&gt;Route CHỈ operator (OperatorGuard → 403 operator_required)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;POST alerts/ack-all · POST alerts/:id/ack · GET/PUT me/alert-preferences · POST me/alert-preferences/test-email · PUT projects/:id/storage-quota&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#555555&quot;&gt;alerts.controller.ts:54-85  ·  projects.controller.ts:183&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="180" width="640" height="74" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="&lt;b&gt;Cảnh báo xuyên project&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Operator thấy mọi cảnh báo; owner chỉ thấy cảnh báo dung lượng project mình, không ack được&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#555555&quot;&gt;alerts-api.ts:118,144&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="262" width="640" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="&lt;b&gt;Danh sách &amp;#x27;Tất cả dự án&amp;#x27; + thống kê xuyên project&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Thấy mọi project (member=false nếu không là thành viên), thống kê qua escape hatch cross-tenant&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#555555&quot;&gt;projects.controller.ts:141,151&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="332" width="640" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="&lt;b&gt;Miễn trần&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Trần số project/user (ADR-118); trần source mỗi project (console, /v1/p, kết nối provider, tạo key kiểu api)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#555555&quot;&gt;projects.controller.ts:260  ·  source-limit.ts:19  ·  api-key-create.ts:28&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="402" width="640" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="&lt;b&gt;Realtime&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Vào room ops của project: nhận alert.changed; mất cờ giữa chừng → rời room, vẫn giữ kết nối nếu còn là thành viên&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#555555&quot;&gt;realtime.gateway.ts:221,264-266,299&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="472" width="640" height="74" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="&lt;b&gt;Email cảnh báo&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Chỉ operator đã xác minh nhận email cảnh báo; owner không nhận&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#555555&quot;&gt;identity.repository.ts:521  ·  alert-email.sender.ts:64&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="554" width="640" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="&lt;b&gt;Quản lý thành viên&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lời mời của operator luôn còn hiệu lực; coi như owner khi không là thành viên&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#555555&quot;&gt;members.service.ts:134,205&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="624" width="640" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="&lt;b&gt;Giao diện&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Menu tài khoản: &amp;#x27;Cài đặt&amp;#x27; chỉ operator; &amp;#x27;Cảnh báo&amp;#x27; cho operator hoặc owner&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#555555&quot;&gt;account-routes.ts:34-35&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="694" width="640" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="&lt;b&gt;③ DẤU VẾT&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1330" y="80" width="520" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="&lt;b&gt;audit_logs  action = &amp;#x27;operator.access&amp;#x27;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Khi operator KHÔNG là thành viên và đi qua ProjectScopeGuard: ghi MỖI request, TRƯỚC khi handler chạy; tenant = project bị truy cập; actor = user.id; metadata {method, path}&lt;br&gt;Kèm log pino &amp;#x27;operator.access&amp;#x27;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#555555&quot;&gt;project-scope.guard.ts:75-85&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1330" y="110" width="540" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="&lt;b&gt;Xin vé socket cũng ghi&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;GET /auth/socket-ticket vào project không phải của mình → cùng audit operator.access (R-13)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#555555&quot;&gt;socket-ticket.service.ts:29-37&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1330" y="280" width="540" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="&lt;b&gt;Hành động ghi của operator&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;vẫn ghi audit riêng như người khác, vd project.storage_quota_changed {before, after} cùng transaction&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#555555&quot;&gt;projects.controller.ts:196-206&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1330" y="390" width="540" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c27" value="&lt;b&gt;Operator KHÔNG phải superuser của dữ liệu&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Vẫn đi qua hub_app + RLS + TenantScopedRepository (app.project_id = project đang vào); không BYPASSRLS.&lt;br&gt;• Operator LÀ thành viên của project → role thật (vd viewer chỉ có viewer), không viaOperator, không audit operator.access. Web có thể vẫn hiện nút theo cờ operator (vd canWrite ở sources/storage) nhưng server từ chối nếu role thật thiếu scope.&lt;br&gt;• Không có scope riêng &amp;#x27;operator&amp;#x27; trong ALL_SCOPES; đặc quyền là cờ + OperatorGuard + ngoại lệ ghi trong code.&lt;br&gt;• Muốn thu quyền: gỡ is_operator ở DB (không có API); phiên đang mở nhận cờ mới ở lần kiểm session kế tiếp." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1330" y="520" width="540" height="250" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c28" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1330" y="800" width="250" height="192" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c29" value="&lt;b&gt;Chú giải&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1338" y="804" width="230" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c30" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1340" y="830" width="22" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c31" value="Chủ thể (ai gọi)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1370" y="828" width="205" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c32" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1340" y="858" width="22" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c33" value="Cổng xác thực" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1370" y="856" width="205" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c34" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1340" y="886" width="22" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c35" value="Cổng project (thuộc project nào)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1370" y="884" width="205" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c36" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1340" y="914" width="22" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c37" value="Cổng scope (được làm gì)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1370" y="912" width="205" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c38" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1340" y="942" width="22" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c39" value="Đặc quyền / dấu vết operator" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1370" y="940" width="205" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c40" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1340" y="970" width="22" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c41" value="Ghi chú, ngoại lệ" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1370" y="968" width="205" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c42" value="&lt;b&gt;Tóm tắt&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Operator = owner của mọi project + vài route riêng + miễn trần + nhận cảnh báo — và mọi lần vào project người khác đều có dấu vết." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="774" width="640" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
